WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.484
Now, let's put an AI to work. Open the launcher from the dock, or press Control N.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:12.069
Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini. Every agent you have installed, right here, side by side.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.443
Meet Nova. Every agent gets a codename, so you can talk to it by name.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.992
Give it a task. Just say who it's for, and what you want, and LATYS gets it to the right agent.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:30.163
Then watch it work. Reading files, writing code, running your tests. Live, in a real terminal.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.270
When it's done, the brief shows exactly what changed. Click any file to review it.
